     "body": "<p>Course of action is to try:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>reindexing objects with Fedora’s JMS disabled but also logging up to DEBUG and look for any event messages being emitted.</li>\n\t<li>stand up a Fedora and hit it with Apache Bench at 1,000 to 10,000 concurrent requests for longer and longer timeframes looking for the memory increase, try with metrics to see if something appears.</li>\n</ol>\n",
